 "note": "new architecture (user, 2026-11-13): base ct charge model (sigma_bounds, ct conductance) + cutoff 6 + cs conditioning (c6cs); 128 channels, lmax 3, 5 layers, 12 radial functions, envelope p 6, avg_n_neighbors of the cutoff-6 table, x_norm spectral (hill lifts far-neighbour signals of lone atoms), Huber deltas E/F/S 0.05/0.25/0.05 with weights 1/1/1, EMA 0.999, no DeNS, species_rank 32, peak lr 0.01, 4 nodes x 4 GPUs (48 graphs per device, 768 per step). Code thole-merge b2fdc08. n_epochs 300 (about 37.5 h at 7.5 min per epoch; user 2026-11-14). | v2spin (user, 2026-11-14): v2 + spin-polarisation energy in invariant spin variables (local moments mu, pair correlations c; E = sum Delta mu + 1/2 W mu^2 + sum J mu mu c, W from DFTB spin constants), restricted singlets mu = 0 (row flag 'unrestricted'), NBO spin and charge heads (outputs, from the Lowdin labels by a local redistribution inside ct_switch), spin_weight 0.01/16 (Lowdin spins; per-device scaling as the dipole weight). | v2local (user, 2026-11-14): v2spin + local charge / spin conditioning (long_range cs_local [4.5, 6.0]: Qbar_i = sum_j s(r_ij) q0_j and 2Sbar_i from the molecule charges / spins instead of the graph totals; size consistent for separated fragments) and bounded NBO pair coefficients (nbo_t_max 0.5); trained from scratch (user), n_epochs 260 (ends before the compute window closes, time left for Laplace UQ and evaluation). | 2026-11-14 16:10 (epoch ~27): long_range ct_cond_max 100 added on resume (g had drifted to 12, conductance 3e10). | v3 (user, 2026-11-15): v2local + long_range ct_decay [4, 2] learned per element pair (beta >= 2.5; the charge transfer fades instead of stepping at 4.5 A), ct_cond_max 100, ema_warmup, polar.dispersion (C6 from the Thole alpha, TS combination, BJ damping), x_readout_norm_eps 3e-3 (soft readout norm: no lone-neighbour amplification, Ar2 / Li+...Xe); from scratch on 3 nodes x 4 GPUs (576 graphs per step), n_epochs set to end before the compute window closes. energy_weight 10 (user, 2026-11-15: the energy was 3-4 % of the loss). Restarted 2026-11-15 06:50 with the per-atom gathers (commit after 51db7a0; the learned beta had doubled the step time), 185 epochs. n_epochs 185 -> 170 at epoch 3 (475 s per epoch).",
